I am new to kernel development and am working on a network driver.  The App=
liedMicro 405EX chip provides dual EMAC ports and the driver for those is t=
he ibm_newemac driver.  I discovered an issue last year with said driver th=
at I am trying to fix now.=0A=
=0A=
